ol i was just getting  trouble just for doing a lot of  weird stuff and hanging around with the  wrong people some kids were getting all  over me and one of the staff was just  watching and and i was right in front of  her and she did nothing  this school has really helped me get  through so many tough times  they have a lot of smart people that  make smart choices and i hang out with  them now  the school is like  my dream school  good morning  [Music]  without transportation many of the kids  would not go to school  so one of the things that we provide at  our school that's critical to our  student success  and overall family support is our  transportation we transport 59 students  every day to school using two shuttle  buses that each take on two routes so  starting at 5 30.  by providing transportation we're  alleviating some of the burden on our  families and really creating more  opportunity for them to have one less  thing to worry about  pound we pounding this morning  we want breakfast when a student first  arrives in the morning at crete  they're greeted by our dean of students  who usually stands at the front gate  and  majority 90 of the students will come  and get breakfast  do good  that's all i want to know  we  first of all understand that there are  basic needs that must be met before we  can educate our kids before we put math  or science or social studies before you  we want to make sure that your mind your  body and everything else is intact so we  offer three meals a day we offer  mental health resources through our  wellness program so on-site social  workers full-time  all the things that you would need just  to be a healthy human  [Music]  i didn't have a car the first year that  crete opened up but the school made sure  my kids were  on the shuttle and they never missed  school because of that  i'm a single mom i was married for seven  years and i left due to domestic  violence  being in the shelter and being in this  space in my life where 